  "body": "## Infrastructure & Configuration\n\n### Additions\n- `.github/workflows/ci.yml` — CI workflow for L2-L5 kernel tests + air-gapped boot validation\n- `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` — agent configuration for AI-assisted development\n- `SESSION_SUMMARY.md` — development session log\n- `.gitignore` updates\n\n### Removals\n- `gpu/` — entire GPU pipeline (CUDA kernels, weights-only safety, model.py, etc.) — CPU-only focus\n- `assets/`, `media/`, `src/assets/` — marketing and benchmark images\n- `CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md` — replaced with CONTRIBUTING.md (in docs PR)\n\n### CI workflow features\n- Builds all 13 test targets\n- Runs air-gapped boot test\n- Graceful SKIPPED handling for environment-dependent tests\n\n**Part of a split from original PR #567.**",
  "closed_at": "2026-06-21T20:12:04Z",
